[{"client_msg_id":"5cf2c933-df63-41a0-8a7a-be40726ffe72","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"なぜか実軸上に特異点がある場合と考えてしまってました...\nその場合は普通にそう、というやつですね...","ts":"1619925860.212000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=A/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c3d5d53b-67ec-46a1-9cb3-df238543ece3","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"あ、失礼、なんも読めてなかった...","ts":"1619925777.211000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kdAwL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f36fad71-cdf8-48a8-9c81-2308279000e8","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"ちゃんと計算できるかな...","ts":"1619925333.209800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cMDkQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8b8fb932-f50f-4c44-b633-7b7596fe4fbe","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"あー R -\u0026gt; \\inf にする半円と r -\u0026gt; 0 にする半円の二つとってうまく経路書けばよかった気がする","ts":"1619925239.208700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lj15"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5475d76c-c0fc-4d8f-ad7f-70197d1c1dea","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/hyuki/status/1387686063972384769?s=19|https://twitter.com/hyuki/status/1387686063972384769?s=19\u003e","ts":"1619922842.207000","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/hyuki|@hyuki\u003e: 最新刊のアナウンスです。新シリーズ「数学ガールの物理ノート」開始！:blush:\n\n　＊　＊　＊\n\n結城浩『数学ガールの物理ノート／ニュートン力学』\n\u003chttps://www.amazon.co.jp/dp/4815609772/?tag=hyuki-22\u003e","id":1,"author_name":"結城浩","author_subname":"@hyuki","author_link":"https://twitter.com/hyuki/status/1387686063972384769","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/556785665845624832/svOdvq6q_normal.png","text":"最新刊のアナウンスです。新シリーズ「数学ガールの物理ノート」開始！:blush:\n\n　＊　＊　＊\n\n結城浩『数学ガールの物理ノート／ニュートン力学』\n\u003chttps://www.amazon.co.jp/dp/4815609772/?tag=hyuki-22\u003e","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1619685114,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/hyuki/status/1387686063972384769?s=19","original_url":"https://twitter.com/hyuki/status/1387686063972384769?s=19"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"majika","count":3,"users":["U7B4ZD49X","UAZ33BKV2","UD1FQV38V"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VryU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"68f0ac92-004d-4291-952f-fa071d45eb97","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"あるある","ts":"1619912574.206300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yI2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f91d691c-dd1a-4184-9fb6-2ae277d8014e","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"私も工学よりの人間なので似たようなことやりますね〜。\nどちらかというとうちの分野だと「デルタ関数周りの演算をテキトーに済ましちゃう」とか「Fourier 変換で逆変換できる関数かどうかをちゃんと確かめずに逆変換しちゃう」とかが多いかな…","ts":"1619912559.206100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+C9Z+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7b2e8a24-9bcc-4cb9-84db-8c4a6d99e7e2","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"物理だと無理のある積分をとりあえず:yoshi: して進める事があるので、ちょいちょい見ますね","ts":"1619912404.204400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mBC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4007e771-99d4-4793-afaa-bb518be062a6","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"いえ、私も Cauchy の主値まわりはあまり理解できてなかったです。ありがとうございます","ts":"1619912351.203600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3wt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0e6d531d-4a0a-4452-8dc3-a94ad21ca97d","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"ありがとうございます！","ts":"1619912292.203100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yHsh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6250bd51-4518-4a49-b366-77eb3b620e47","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"とりあえず納得しました","ts":"1619912289.202900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SEkBW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"098d191e-931f-4d1a-b437-0c4a775c0982","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"に分けているので、周回積分かどうかは関係ないのでは？","ts":"1619912050.201700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9S4Y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a6e7ce72-82bb-4000-a917-bff778dfa995","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"主値積分＝主値積分が必要な項＋主値とか関係なく成り立つ項","ts":"1619912030.201200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+HAx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e305a8a4-a8ae-4f52-9d28-9a2d3ecd91f7","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"物理の世界では Cauchy の主値使うんですね。私はそのあたり知らないので「Cauchy の主値なんて考えて意味あんのかなー」とか思ってました。","ts":"1619912007.200700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ICIha"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1f72390c-9270-4b56-9f03-49e2baf719b8","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"いや、これも同様に `(a-R, a+R)` を直径とする半円を積分経路とすると、 C2 が常に0となる、みたいな話なのかな？であれば辻褄が合うかも？（あんまり自信ない）","ts":"1619911952.199900","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1619911978.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UwC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6929d3fc-98ae-413a-9087-d9cd2772a542","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"用途は物理なので:yoshi:","ts":"1619911913.199200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0q5C"}]},{"client_msg_id":"df1b71c4-5ca5-4770-8845-3b36f1db3797","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"でも「周回積分の値が Cauchy の主値と等しくなる」、つまり実質的に周回積分の結果を Cauchy の主値と見て良い理由はちょっと私にはよく分からないですね…","ts":"1619911864.198600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CioMq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2728523f-d4a0-46dd-99de-28013b8c0f56","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"前者の主値が0になるのは (a-R, a+R) の積分値が（対称性により）常に0となることから示せそうです！","ts":"1619911795.197700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"desune","count":1,"users":["U01D9BALEKU"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vly"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8af73115-4734-46a4-90a2-96193988deef","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"こう分解すれば前は主値積分が（たぶん）ゼロ、後ろは普通に留数定理で求まる","ts":"1619911750.197100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"n6xr8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"02285a62-f8ca-49fd-bbab-d18abd2f8455","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"なるほど。前者は主値0になりますね","ts":"1619911746.196900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LBJdO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cf5c4652-0531-4aa8-8433-b4ef2920f91c","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"x/((x-a)^2+b^2) = 1/2 * (2(x-a))/((x-a)^2+b^2) + a/((x-a)^2+b^2)","ts":"1619911714.196000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0jGd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"62920eee-0254-4ccd-941d-2f8574d3b459","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"わかった","ts":"1619911655.194700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PcNL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a49f500b-f94c-4e56-baf3-621260a000c6","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"そうです","ts":"1619911227.193800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+lw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"593f38a3-9380-4b10-bf74-ee9ffeffe5c9","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"Cauchy の主値を求めたい感じです？","ts":"1619911221.193600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7K4EM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5ead2cd2-9c5e-4438-8bb2-f75f16a8ce23","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"原始関数か","ts":"1619911182.193400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LWta"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9cae9419-2822-4ea3-ad8e-bec51dfbbf0d","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"うーん結局この場合、留数定理は使えなくて母関数をあらわに求める必要がある？","ts":"1619911133.192800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GN7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"264b9f8c-e661-40b1-803f-d829e829d919","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"Wikipedia もそうなっていた \u003chttps://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%B3%E3%83%BC%E3%82%B7%E3%83%BC%E3%81%AE%E4%B8%BB%E5%80%A4\u003e","ts":"1619911101.192000","attachments":[{"fallback":"wikipedia: コーシーの主値","id":1,"author_name":"Wikipedia","author_link":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/","title":"コーシーの主値","title_link":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%B3%E3%83%BC%E3%82%B7%E3%83%BC%E3%81%AE%E4%B8%BB%E5%80%A4","text":"数学において、コーシーの主値（英: Cauchy principal value）とは、ある種の広義積分に対して定められる値のことである。","blocks":null,"service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/wikipedia.png","from_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%B3%E3%83%BC%E3%82%B7%E3%83%BC%E3%81%AE%E4%B8%BB%E5%80%A4","original_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%B3%E3%83%BC%E3%82%B7%E3%83%BC%E3%81%AE%E4%B8%BB%E5%80%A4"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"y+peM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"72f71a44-a8b9-41da-b1cd-84a1a09f86f6","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"\u0026gt; `(-a, a)` を積分区間としたときの `a → ∞` における極限値が主値となります。\nこれのはずです。↓によると\n\u003chttp://tau.doshisha.ac.jp/lectures/2009.calculus-I/html.dir/node153.html\u003e","ts":"1619911069.191700","attachments":[{"fallback":"6.30 コーシーの主値積分","id":1,"title":"6.30 コーシーの主値積分","title_link":"http://tau.doshisha.ac.jp/lectures/2009.calculus-I/html.dir/node153.html","text":"6.30 コーシーの主値積分","blocks":null,"service_name":"tau.doshisha.ac.jp","service_icon":"http://tau.doshisha.ac.jp/favicon.ico","from_url":"http://tau.doshisha.ac.jp/lectures/2009.calculus-I/html.dir/node153.html","original_url":"http://tau.doshisha.ac.jp/lectures/2009.calculus-I/html.dir/node153.html"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WmzRd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"35459270-11e0-4009-a772-120a631c9312","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"\u0026gt; 複素平面の上半分を回る積分をして実部とって\nこれが正当化できるか、ということです","ts":"1619911036.191400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8T/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ec32f73c-b7c1-4cb0-8be8-926083022541","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"この場合の主値 $\\mathrm{PV} \\int_\\infty^\\infty f(x) dx$ の求め方、というか定義としてはどうなりますか？","ts":"1619911000.190700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DqC3Y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"15727e78-ed67-49b4-9049-2ecc877ea060","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"はい。私もちゃんと確かめてないですが、 f(x) ~ 1/x なので発散すると思います。","ts":"1619910782.188300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/jIr9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"91fc91e2-528d-4537-8c2f-72549611a8f8","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"あ、いや1/xなら積分で発散するのか","ts":"1619910742.187800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Pd/D"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cc658802-34c4-4b2a-b33c-9ab9dc1a47f5","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"どうして積分が 2 π i * (a + ib における留数) の結果と一致しないんだ、という話ですが、\n「複素平面の上半分を回る積分」で一般的にとられる積分路は（実軸上に極がないとき）\nC1: 実軸を -R から R の方向に結ぶ経路\nC2: 半径 R の円周上の上半分（虚部 \u0026gt;= 0 に相当する部分）を反時計回りにまわる経路\nの2つを考えて、C = C1 + C2 の周回積分を考えることが多いと思います。\nR → ∞ としたときに ∫C2 f(z) dz の値が0に収束してくれれば ∮C f(z) dz の値（これは留数定理で求まる）が∫C1 f(z) dz と等しくなるので問題ないんですが、\n今回は分母の次数が分子の次数 + 2 よりも小さいので、 ∫C2 f(z) dz の値が0に収束しないんですよね。たぶん。","ts":"1619910736.187600","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1619910745.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"So=L"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5ccaf5ad-69f5-47a3-b057-f08f6890d6fe","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"ありがとうございます\nx\u0026gt;\u0026gt;1 で f(x) ~ 1/x なので発散しないと思ったのですが","ts":"1619910732.187400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ldWo4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"db77422c-5673-46a8-a2e6-08935e296acd","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"長らく解析学から離れてたのであんまし自信ないですが、\n`(-∞, ∞)` を積分区間とするときの広義積分は `(-a, b)` を積分区間としたときの積分値が `a → ∞, b → ∞` としたとき「a, b の近づけ方によらずに」収束する場合に収束すると定義されるはずです。\nそうでない場合は広義積分が収束するとはみなされず、 `(-a, a)` を積分区間としたときの `a → ∞` における極限値が主値となります。\n今回はたぶん `(0, ∞)`で積分すると正の無限大に発散し、 `(-∞, 0)` で積分すると負の無限大に発散するので、全体としては収束しないという判定となります","ts":"1619910353.181000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5g=Zl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"da052a52-5c02-420c-94f8-3d5255f37358","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"複素平面の上半分を回る積分をして実部とって`I=πa/b` でいいかなと思ったのですが、実軸上に極がないときの主値の扱い（定義）がわからず自信ないです","ts":"1619899859.170000","edited":{"user":"U01D9BALEKU","ts":"1619899869.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KZiF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"96cd3713-2fd6-4167-9075-d5e772964bcc","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"`f(z)=z/((z-a)^2+b^2)` の極は`z=a±ib` , それぞれでの留数は`i2π*Res[a±ib, f(z)] = ±π*a/b + iπ` です","ts":"1619899591.168500","edited":{"user":"U01D9BALEKU","ts":"1619899806.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qOo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"49d063de-2f4d-44f0-bb4b-d270b8526ead","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"複素解析わかる方教えてほしいのですが\n`a, b \u0026gt; 0` として、`x/((x-a)^2+b^2)` を区間`(-∞,∞)` で積分した場合について、積分は収束せずに主値`pi*a/b` が得られるようです（wolframalphaが収束しないって言ってました）\nこれはどうやって正当化されるのでしょうか？","ts":"1619899421.166400","edited":{"user":"U01D9BALEKU","ts":"1619899479.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bYFT3"}]}]
